---
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
import claudio1 from "../../assets/claudio1.png";
---

<header id="top" class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="eyebrow">
                <span class="bar"></span>
                <span class="idx">DEEP DIVE</span>
                <span>Curso 54h · Azure VM · 6 Sessões 1:1 · SSD & WAF</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="hero-title">
                Pare de provisionar VMs no <span class="crossed">improviso</span
                >.<br />
                Vire um <span class="flame">Arquiteto de Nuvem</span> que projeta
                infraestrutura de elite.
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-sub">
                A imersão definitiva para Engenheiros que querem dominar <strong
                    >Azure Virtual Machines do átomo ao código declarativo</strong
                > · Portal, CLI e Terraform · e finalmente serem ouvidos nas decisões
                de arquitetura.
            </p>

            <ul class="hero-points">
                <li>
                    <svg
                        width="18"
                        height="18"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2.5"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                    >
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                        ><strong>54 horas</strong> divididas em 6 módulos sequenciais
                        · do hipervisor ao Zero Trust.</span
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <svg
                        width="18"
                        height="18"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2.5"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                    >
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                        >Cada tópico em <strong>5 frentes operacionais</strong>:
                        Teoria, Portal, CLI, Terraform e Spec-Driven Dev ·
                        fluidez total.</span
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <svg
                        width="18"
                        height="18"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2.5"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                    >
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                        >Curso ministrado por <strong
                            >Microsoft MVP &amp; Docker Captain</strong
                        > + <strong>6 sessões de mentoria 1:1</strong> com o Cláudio.</span
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <svg
                        width="18"
                        height="18"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2.5"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                    >
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                        ><strong>Certificado próprio</strong> O Sertao será Cloud
                        · assinado por Microsoft MVP.</span
                    >
                </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="hero-cta-row">
                <Button href="#investimento" variant="primary" size="massive">
                    Quero ser Arquiteto de Nuvem
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2.5"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                        >
                            <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </Button>
                <Button href="#ementa" variant="ghost">
                    <svg
                        width="14"
                        height="14"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="currentColor"
                        style="margin-right: 8px;"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M12 2l2.09 6.26H20l-4.95 3.64L16.9 18 12 14.27 7.1 18l1.85-6.1L4 8.26h5.91z"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                    Ver Ementa Completa
                </Button>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-meta">
                <span>
                    <svg
                        width="14"
                        height="14"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2"
                    >
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                        <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    54h DE CONTEÚDO
                </span>
                <span>
                    <svg
                        width="14"
                        height="14"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2"
                    >
                        <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect>
                        <path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"></path>
                    </svg>
                    6 MÓDULOS
                </span>
                <span>
                    <svg
                        width="14"
                        height="14"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M12 2L3 7l9 5 9-5-9-5zM3 17l9 5 9-5M3 12l9 5 9-5"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                    PORTAL · CLI · TERRAFORM · IA
                </span>
                <span>
                    <svg
                        width="14"
                        height="14"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M12 2v6M12 22v-2M4.93 4.93l4.24 4.24M14.83 14.83l4.24 4.24M2 12h6M22 12h-2M4.93 19.07l4.24-4.24M14.83 9.17l4.24-4.24"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                    ACESSO 12 MESES
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-portrait-wrap">
            <img
                src={claudio1.src}
                alt="Cláudio Filipe Lima Raposo segurando uma chama elétrica azul"
            />
            <div class="brackets">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="portrait-stats">
                <div class="portrait-stat">⟡ <b>2× MVP</b> · MICROSOFT</div>
                <div class="portrait-stat">⟡ <b>CAPTAIN</b> · DOCKER</div>
            </div>
            <div class="portrait-tag">
                <span class="name">Cláudio F. L. Raposo</span>
                <div class="badges">
                    <span class="b">PROFESSOR PRINCIPAL</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<style>
    .hero {
        padding: 80px 0 80px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: -80px;
        right: -120px;
        width: 700px;
        height: 700px;
        background: radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% 50%,
            rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.25),
            transparent 60%
        );
        filter: blur(12px);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
        gap: 64px;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
        .hero-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }
    }

    /* Eyebrow específico do Hero */
    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.28em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .eyebrow .bar {
        width: 28px;
        height: 1px;
        background: currentColor;
        opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .eyebrow .idx {
        border: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong);
        padding: 3px 8px;
        background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.06);
        font-size: 10px;
    }

    .hero-title {
        font-family: "Chakra Petch", sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.012em;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .hero-title :global(.flame) {
        color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
        font-style: italic;
        text-shadow:
            0 0 32px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6),
            0 0 80px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.25);
    }

    .hero-title :global(.crossed) {
        text-decoration: line-through;
        text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 90, 90, 0.7);
        color: var(--texto-terciario);
        font-style: normal;
    }

    .hero-sub {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--texto-secundario);
        max-width: 56ch;
        font-weight: 300;
        margin: 0 0 22px;
    }

    .hero-sub strong {
        color: var(--texto-principal);
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .hero-points {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .hero-points li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--texto-secundario);
    }

    .hero-points li svg {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
        margin-top: 2px;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6));
    }

    .hero-cta-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 14px;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero-meta {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 24px;
        font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--texto-secundario);
        padding-top: 24px;
        border-top: 1px dashed var(--hairline);
    }

    .hero-meta span {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .hero-meta svg {
        color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
    }

    /* Hero portrait wrap (Exactamente igual ao index.html) */
    .hero-portrait-wrap {
        position: relative;
        aspect-ratio: 4/5;
        max-width: 480px;
        margin-left: auto;
        border: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong);
        background: var(--neutro-escuro);
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-portrait-wrap img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        filter: saturate(1.1) contrast(1.05);
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero-portrait-wrap::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
            linear-gradient(
                180deg,
                rgba(10, 15, 30, 0) 50%,
                rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.8) 100%
            ),
            repeating-linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                transparent 0,
                transparent 3px,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18) 3px,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18) 4px
            );
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 2;
    }

    .brackets {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 3;
    }

    .brackets span {
        position: absolute;
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        border-color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
        border-style: solid;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.7));
    }

    .brackets span:nth-child(1) {
        top: -1px;
        left: -1px;
        border-width: 2px 0 0 2px;
    }
    .brackets span:nth-child(2) {
        top: -1px;
        right: -1px;
        border-width: 2px 2px 0 0;
    }
    .brackets span:nth-child(3) {
        bottom: -1px;
        left: -1px;
        border-width: 0 0 2px 2px;
    }
    .brackets span:nth-child(4) {
        bottom: -1px;
        right: -1px;
        border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
    }

    .portrait-tag {
        position: absolute;
        left: 16px;
        bottom: 16px;
        z-index: 4;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .portrait-tag .name {
        font-family: "Chakra Petch", sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .portrait-tag .badges {
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .portrait-tag .b {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 9px;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 4px 8px;
        background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong);
        color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
    }

    .portrait-stats {
        position: absolute;
        top: 16px;
        right: 16px;
        z-index: 4;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: flex-end;
    }

    .portrait-stat {
        background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.78);
        border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        padding: 8px 12px;
        font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--texto-secundario);
    }

    .portrait-stat b {
        color: var(--nucleo-eletrico);
        font-weight: 500;
    }
</style>
